    FIX-0006: reproduce and fix the search/invoice price mismatch

    Front-desk staff report that the price shown when they search for a
    program to quote a customer doesn't match the final invoice amount for
    that same registration. search() never picked up the modernization
    levy from REFACTOR-0003 / FEAT-0004 — that logic only ever lived in
    invoice.ts.

    Adds a regression test (Test 33b) that quotes FT-110-A for a resident
    and checks it against priceFor for the same offering and a matching
    resident customer, then fixes it the same way REFACTOR-0003 fixed
    invoice.ts: name search's own 1.25 and 1.05, and add the levy it was
    missing.

